# Keep the build context small and free of host-built (Windows) binaries — the
# image installs its own Linux deps. Never copy these in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
backend/public
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/cypress/videos
**/cypress/screenshots
**/cypress/downloads
